<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/"><channel><title>道德经 · 每日一章</title><link>https://zj-gu.github.io/x3-feed/</link><description>《道德经》每日一章：每天零点从八十一章中随机撷取一章，竖排大字，常读常新。</description><language>zh-cn</language><item><title>今日一章 · 第16章</title><description><![CDATA[<img src="https://zj-gu.github.io/x3-feed/wallpapers/ddj_16.jpg"/><p>致虚极，守静笃。万物并作，吾以观复。夫物芸芸，各复归其根。归根曰静，是谓复命。复命曰常，知常曰明。不知常，妄作凶。知常容，容乃公，公乃全，全乃天，天乃道，道乃久，没身不殆。</p>]]></description><enclosure url="https://zj-gu.github.io/x3-feed/wallpapers/ddj_16.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><media:content url="https://zj-gu.github.io/x3-feed/wallpapers/ddj_16.jpg" type="image/jpeg" medium="image"/><link>https://zj-gu.github.io/x3-feed/wallpapers/ddj_16.jpg</link><guid isPermaLink="false">ddj-16-20261125</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 08:38:26 +0800</pubDate></item></channel></rss>